        rdfs:comment                   "Official hat, woven silk with gilt metal and silk cord, China, Qing dynasty, 1800-1850"@en , "Official hat of stiffened white silk, woven with a delicate stripe pattern; it is edged with a narrow strip of silk brocade. The hat is surmounted by a gilt metal ornament pierced and chased with a pattern of foliage; down its sides hang tassels of red silk cord. Lined with red silk damask."@en ;
